# Single source: the root `.env.example`. Copy it to `.env` for compose
# (`make up` / `make dev`) AND to `apps/noite/.dev.vars` for the worker
# dev process (`vite dev` reads that path) — same values, one definition,
# with one exception: keep RUNNER_TARGET=compose in `.dev.vars` (vite dev
# has no container runtime; the wrangler `vars` fleet default is container).
# Fill in secrets; production values come from deploy env / `wrangler
# secret`, never from a checked-in file.
